-- Combined ClickHouse schema (created at runtime via `cat`).
-- This file is referenced by docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/ to ensure
-- tables and materialized views are created in a single transaction.
-- It does NOT replace the per-file sources in tables/ and materialized-views/
-- (those remain the canonical source for code review) — it is rebuilt by
-- build-all-services.bat / Makefile.
